{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21047","headline":"春怀引 · 李贺","name":"春怀引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳蹊密影成花洞，柳结浓烟花带重。\n蟾蜍碾玉挂明弓，扞拨装金打仙凤。\n宝枕垂云选春梦，钿合碧寒龙脑冻。\n阿侯系锦觅周郎，凭仗东风好相送。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}